    // above it the bits under 2^11 - all far below binary32's last bit there - are
    // folded into a sticky bit at 2^11 (round to odd), which the double then holds
    // exactly and __mec_d2f rounds as the whole value would. Twin of cSzF32 in
    // languages/c-interpreter.abnf.
